---
description: Clean up unused code/imports after edits
globs: app/src/main/java/**/*.kt
alwaysApply: false
---

# Cleanup after edits

- After adding or refactoring code, **remove anything no longer used**:
  - Unused imports.
  - Dead composables / helper functions / data classes that have no references.
  - Commented-out legacy blocks that are not part of an active migration.
- Prefer running IDE “optimize imports” / “find usages” flows before sending changes.
- Do not keep speculative abstractions “for later” — only keep types that are used today or are clearly wired into the current feature.

